Sun Oct 18 09:43:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.1.15:
  * Requires vsg 1.1.16 and vsgXchange 1.1.14; raise the
    cmake(vsg) BuildRequires floor accordingly
  * New examples: vsgwireframe (custom ShaderSet), mesh-shader and
    meshlet rendering, offscreen screenshot, texture projection
  * Standardized command line across examples: --args, -f frame
    count, --select GPU device
  * Soft-shadow improvements and --sRGB/--RGB buffer selection
  * Optional meshoptimizer integration for mesh optimization
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- Drop obsolete Group: tag

